# - Credentials for harness skills. Copy to .env.skills (gitignored) in the main checkout.
# - GITHUB_TOKEN: fine-grained personal access token limited to this repository.
#   Repository permissions: Contents read/write, Pull requests read/write, Issues read/write, Commit statuses read,
#   Checks read. Administration read/write only if you use repo-create or repo-set-template.
# - GITHUB_REPO: optional owner/name; defaults to the origin remote.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
GITHUB_REPO=
